// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// WORLD 1-1 — overworld
//
// Generated by tools/smb-gen-world1.mjs from the original's area data — see
// reference/smb-areas.json. Pipe columns and heights, hole widths, block rows,
// the staircases, the flagpole and the castle are the original's own numbers,
// not an approximation of them. Re-run the generator rather than editing by
// hand.
//
// The hand-authored version of this level had two pipes that do not exist in
// the original (columns 110 and 122), was missing the one at 179, had the pipe
// at 163 a row too high, put the star in the wrong brick, and gave 1-1 piranha
// plants — which it has none of: VerticalPipe's plant is skipped when
// AreaNumber and WorldNumber are both zero, and 1-1 is the only level that is.
//
// The castle column is the original's 202 + 1: our castle base is cut open so
// the walk-off can reach the door, and the sprite is drawn one tile right.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

